IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nt-interpretation-time`

-- Section 17 of the Interpretation Act 1978 (Northern Territory): the definitions, reprint as in force at 21 April 2023.
--
-- Two halves.
-- The first half is a table with one entry for each term that section 17 defines, produced by a script that reads the text file:
-- the term as printed, how the section defines it (means, means and includes, includes, has the meaning in a provision of this Act, has the same meaning as in another law, see),
-- the wording as printed, and where a definition points elsewhere, the provision or law it points at.
-- A term defined by "means" is a closed definition; one defined by "includes" is open; a pointer to another law is not resolved here (the other laws are not among the sources).
-- The definitions that sit inside other sections (25(6), 40(2), 51(2), 67(4) and 72A) are encoded beside those sections.
-- The second half is hand-written functions for the definitions that decide a case from facts.

DECLARE `How a term is defined in section 17` IS ONE OF
    `means`
    `means and includes`
    `includes`
    `has the meaning in a provision of this Act`
    `has the same meaning as in another law`
    `see`

DECLARE `Definition in section 17` HAS
    `term as printed`                              IS A STRING
    `how defined`                                  IS A `How a term is defined in section 17`
    `wording as printed`                           IS A STRING
    `provision of this Act pointed at`             IS A MAYBE STRING
    `other law pointed at`                         IS A MAYBE STRING
    `provision of the other law pointed at`        IS A MAYBE STRING
    `line in the text file`                        IS A NUMBER

-- src:235 | Act means an Act passed by the Legislative Assembly and assented to under the Northern Territory (Self-Government) Act 1978 (Cth), and includes:
-- src:236 | (a) a Territory Ordinance; and
-- src:237 | (b) an Ordinance or Act of South Australia in its application to the Territory; and
-- src:238 | (c) a part of an Act.
@ref s 17 "Act" (src:235-238)
`definition at line 235` MEANS `Definition in section 17` OF "Act", `means and includes`, "Act means an Act passed by the Legislative Assembly and assented to under the Northern Territory (Self-Government) Act 1978 (Cth), and includes: / (a) a Territory Ordinance; and / (b) an Ordinance or Act of South Australia in its application to the Territory; and / (c) a part of an Act.", (NOTHING), (NOTHING), (NOTHING), 235

